//emojiFx 按键喷图动画插件
//订阅按键事件，触发喷图动画
//由 plugin.loadAll() 通过 loadcodex 加载
import plugin;
import win.ui;
import thread.table;

//获取加载上下文（含 config，从 plugin.json 读取）
var ctx = plugin.getCurrentContext();
var pluginId = ctx.pluginId;
var ownerForm = ctx.ownerForm;
var pluginConfig = ctx.config;

//获取插件目录路径（动画线程内用 loadcodex 加载 shapeData）
var pluginDir = plugin.getPluginDir();

//动画线程句柄
var animThreadHandle = null;

//跨线程通信共享表
var emitQueue = null;
var controlTable = null;

//图形颜色池（ARGB格式，可扩充）
var colorPool = {
	0xFFFF6B6B, 0xFFFF8E8E, 0xFFFF4757, 0xFFE84393,
	0xFFFD79A8, 0xFFFFA502, 0xFFFFBE76, 0xFFFFEAA7,
	0xFF7BED9F, 0xFF2ED573, 0xFF1E90FF, 0xFF70A1FF,
	0xFF5352ED, 0xFFA29BFE, 0xFFDFE6E9, 0xFFFFF200
};

//默认参数值（重置按钮使用）
var DEFAULT_MAX_PARTICLES = 30;
var DEFAULT_RISE_SCALE = 1.0;
var DEFAULT_FPS = 25;

//从配置文件读取参数（首次加载由 plugin.json 提供，后续由 saveConfig 更新）
var MAX_PARTICLES = pluginConfig.maxParticles || DEFAULT_MAX_PARTICLES;
var EMITS_PER_TICK = 2;
var FPS = pluginConfig.fps || DEFAULT_FPS;
var RISE_SCALE = pluginConfig.riseScale || DEFAULT_RISE_SCALE;

//初始化动画模块（启动独立动画线程）
var init = function(ownerForm){
	//检查动画线程是否已意外退出，已退出则清理句柄允许重新启动
	if(animThreadHandle){
		if(thread.stillActive(animThreadHandle)){
			return; //线程仍在运行，不重复启动
		}
		//线程已结束，关闭句柄并重置
		raw.closeHandle(animThreadHandle);
		animThreadHandle = null;
		//清理可能残留的共享表（避免新旧线程通信冲突）
		if(emitQueue){
			emitQueue.release();
			emitQueue = null;
		}
		if(controlTable){
			controlTable.release();
			controlTable = null;
		}
	}

	//创建跨线程通信共享表
	emitQueue = thread.table("{B8E2F1A3-EMOJI-FX01-QUEUE}");
	controlTable = thread.table("{B8E2F1A3-EMOJI-FX01-CTRL}");
	controlTable.dispose = false;
	controlTable.maxParticles = MAX_PARTICLES;
	controlTable.riseScale = RISE_SCALE;

	//获取 shapeData 文件路径，传入动画线程在线程内加载（函数引用无法跨线程序列化）
	var shapeDataPath = pluginDir + "emojiFx\shapeData.aardio";

	//启动动画线程，传递共享表和常量作为参数（子线程无法访问外部闭包上值）
	animThreadHandle = thread.create(
		function(emitQueue, controlTable, colorPool, maxParticles, emitsPerTick, shapeDataPath, initialFps){
			//在子线程中需要重新import所有依赖
			import win.ui;
			import win.ui.layered;
			import gdip.path;
			import gdip.solidBrush;
			import gdip.bitmap;
			import gdip.graphics;
			import gdi;

			//获取屏幕尺寸
			var screenW, screenH = win.getScreen();

			//以1080p为基准的自适应缩放因子
			var scaleFactor = screenH / 1080;

			//创建全屏透明分层窗口
			var fxForm = win.form(
				right = screenW;
				bottom = screenH;
				border = "none";
				title = "";
				topmost = true;
				transparent = true;
			);
			fxForm.modifyStyleEx(0, 0x20/*_WS_EX_TRANSPARENT*/);
			fxForm.modifyStyleEx(0, 0x80/*_WS_EX_TOOLWINDOW*/);
			fxForm.modifyStyleEx(0x40000/*_WS_EX_APPWINDOW*/, 0);

			//用 win.ui.layered 初始化分层窗口（设置透明、背景等）
			var layeredWnd = win.ui.layered(fxForm, -1);

			//在线程内加载 shapeData 并构建矢量图形路径（GDI+对象必须在同一线程创建）
			var shapeData = loadcodex(shapeDataPath);
			var shapePaths = shapeData.buildAll();

			//缓存画刷
			var cachedBrush = gdip.solidBrush(0xFFFFFFFF);

			//粒子数据
			var particles = {};

			//===== 缓存渲染资源，覆盖 redraw 避免每帧创建销毁DC/位图 =====
			var hwnd = fxForm.hwnd;
			var hdc = ::GetDC(hwnd);
			var hMemDc = ::CreateCompatibleDC(hdc);
			//创建全屏DIBSection位图
			var hMemBmp = ::Gdi32.CreateDIBSectionP(hMemDc, {
				INT cbSize = 40;
				int cx = screenW;
				int cy = -screenH;
				WORD planes = 1;
				WORD bitCount = 32;
				INT compression;
				INT size;
				int xpm;
				int ypm;
				INT clrUsed;
				INT clrImportant;
			}, 0, {ptr v}, null, 0);
			var hOldBmp = ::SelectObject(hMemDc, hMemBmp);
			//创建缓存的GDI+ Graphics对象（绑定到hMemDc）
			var cachedGraphics = gdip.graphics(hMemDc);
			cachedGraphics.smoothingMode = 2/*_SmoothingModeHighQuality*/;

			//覆盖 redraw：使用缓存资源，只做绘图+UpdateLayeredWindow
			layeredWnd.redraw = function(){
				//清空画布（全透明）
				cachedGraphics.clear(0x00000000);

				//绘制所有粒子
				for(i=1;#particles;1){
					var p = particles[i];
					var alpha = 255;
					if(p.progress > 0.6){
						alpha = math.floor(255 * (1 - (p.progress - 0.6) / 0.4));
					}
					if(alpha <= 0) continue;

					cachedBrush.color = (alpha << 24) | (p.color & 0xFFFFFF);

					cachedGraphics.saveTransform();
					cachedGraphics.translate(p.x, p.y);
					cachedGraphics.rotate(p.rotation);
					cachedGraphics.scale(p.scale, p.scale);
					p.shape.fill(cachedGraphics, cachedBrush);
					cachedGraphics.restoreTransform();
				}

				//使用aardio封装的updateLayeredWindow（正确处理默认参数）
				gdi.updateLayeredWindow(hwnd, hMemDc, ::SIZE(screenW, screenH));
			}

			//不抢焦点方式显示窗口，并显式置顶确保在所有窗口之上
			::User32.ShowWindow(hwnd, 4/*SW_SHOWNOACTIVATE*/);
			::User32.SetWindowPos(hwnd, -1/*HWND_TOPMOST*/, 0,0,0,0, 0x13/*SWP_NOMOVE|SWP_NOSIZE|SWP_NOACTIVATE*/);
			layeredWnd.redraw();

			//排除任务栏预览
			var DwmApi = raw.loadDll("Dwmapi.dll");
			var excludeFromPeek = { INT value = 1 };
			DwmApi.DwmSetWindowAttribute(hwnd, 12/*_DWMWA_EXCLUDED_FROM_PEEK*/, excludeFromPeek, 4);

			//周期性重新置顶（防止被其他窗口抢占 z-order）
			var lastTopmostTime = time.tick();

			//动画帧更新定时器（帧率由 initialFps 决定，变更帧率需重启插件）
			var timerId = null;
			timerId = fxForm.setInterval(function(){
				//检查退出标志
				if(controlTable.dispose){
				fxForm.clearInterval(timerId);
				timerId = null;
				//清理渲染资源
				cachedGraphics.delete();
				cachedGraphics = null; //置null避免重复释放
				::SelectObject(hMemDc, hOldBmp);
					::DeleteObject(hMemBmp);
					::DeleteDC(hMemDc);
					::ReleaseDC(hwnd, hdc);
					if(cachedBrush) cachedBrush.delete();
					for(i=1;#shapePaths;1){
						shapePaths[i].delete();
					}
					fxForm.close();
					win.quitMessage();
					return;
				}

				//动态读取参数（设置页可实时修改）
				//每2秒重新置顶，防止被其他窗口抢占 z-order
				var now = time.tick();
				if(now - lastTopmostTime > 2000){
					::User32.SetWindowPos(hwnd, -1/*HWND_TOPMOST*/, 0,0,0,0, 0x13/*SWP_NOMOVE|SWP_NOSIZE|SWP_NOACTIVATE*/);
					lastTopmostTime = now;
				}
			//业务逻辑用 try-catch 隔离，防止单帧异常导致线程退出
			try{
				if(controlTable.maxParticles) maxParticles = controlTable.maxParticles;
				var riseScale = controlTable.riseScale ? controlTable.riseScale : 1.0;

				//从共享队列读取emit数据并创建粒子
				var emitCount = math.min(emitQueue.len(), emitsPerTick);
				for(q=1;emitCount;1){
					emitQueue.pop(1); //消费队列项
					if(#particles >= maxParticles){
						//随机移除一个粒子，让不同生命阶段的粒子共存
						var removeIdx = math.random(1, #particles);
						table.remove(particles, removeIdx);
					}

					var shape = shapePaths[math.random(1, #shapePaths)];
					var color = colorPool[math.random(1, #colorPool)];
					var startX = screenW - math.random(50, 200) * scaleFactor;
					var startY = screenH - math.random(20, 60) * scaleFactor;

					table.push(particles, {
						shape = shape;
						color = color;
						x = startX; y = startY;
						startX = startX; startY = startY;
						driftX = math.random(-100, 100) * scaleFactor;
						riseHeight = math.random(300, 500) * scaleFactor * riseScale;
						rotation = math.random(-30, 30);
						rotationSpeed = math.random(-3, 3);
						scale = (0.6 + math.random() * 0.8) * scaleFactor;
						progress = 0;
						speed = 0.008 + math.random() * 0.006;
					});
				}

				//清空剩余队列（防止积累）
				while(emitQueue.len() > 0){
					emitQueue.pop(1);
				}

				if(#particles == 0) return;

				//更新粒子状态
				var i = 1;
				while(i <= #particles){
					var p = particles[i];
					p.progress += p.speed;
					if(p.progress >= 1){
						particles[i] = particles[#particles]; //swap-and-pop O(1)
						table.pop(particles);
						continue;
					}
					var t = p.progress;
					var ease = 1 - (1 - t) * (1 - t) * (1 - t);
					p.x = p.startX + p.driftX * ease;
					p.y = p.startY - p.riseHeight * ease;
					p.rotation = p.rotation + p.rotationSpeed;
					i++;
				}

				layeredWnd.redraw();
			}
			catch(e){
				//异常时清空粒子重置状态，下一帧继续
				particles = {};
			}
		}, math.floor(1000 / initialFps));

			//运行动画线程消息循环（阻塞，直到fxForm关闭）
			win.loopMessage();

			//消息循环退出后清理（兜底，正常退出已在定时器中清理）
			if(cachedGraphics){
				cachedGraphics.delete();
			}
		}, emitQueue, controlTable, colorPool, MAX_PARTICLES, EMITS_PER_TICK, shapeDataPath, FPS
	);
}

//设置最大粒子数（通过共享表传递给动画线程，实时生效）
var setMaxParticles = function(n){
	MAX_PARTICLES = n;
	if(controlTable) controlTable.maxParticles = n;
}

//获取最大粒子数
var getMaxParticles = function(){
	return MAX_PARTICLES;
}

//设置上升高度倍率（通过共享表传递给动画线程，实时生效）
var setRiseScale = function(s){
	RISE_SCALE = s;
	if(controlTable) controlTable.riseScale = s;
}

//获取上升高度倍率
var getRiseScale = function(){
	return RISE_SCALE;
}

//设置帧率（保存到配置，重启插件后生效）
var setFps = function(f){
	FPS = f;
}

//获取帧率
var getFps = function(){
	return FPS;
}

//触发喷图（跨线程共享表，钩子回调零开销）
var emit = function(vkcode){
	if(!emitQueue) return;
	emitQueue.push(vkcode);
}

//清理资源（通知动画线程退出）
var dispose = function(){
	if(!controlTable) return;
	controlTable.dispose = true;
	//等待动画线程退出（最多1秒）
	if(animThreadHandle){
		thread.waitOne(animThreadHandle, 1000);
		raw.closeHandle(animThreadHandle);
		animThreadHandle = null;
	}
	//释放共享表
	if(emitQueue){
		emitQueue.release();
		emitQueue = null;
	}
	controlTable.release();
	controlTable = null;
}

//插件运行状态
var running = false;

//插件实例
var instance = {};

instance.start = function(){
	if(running) return;
	running = true;
	//启动时重新从配置读取参数（设置保存后重启生效）
	var config = plugin.getConfig(pluginId);
	if(config){
		MAX_PARTICLES = config.maxParticles || DEFAULT_MAX_PARTICLES;
		RISE_SCALE = config.riseScale || DEFAULT_RISE_SCALE;
		FPS = config.fps || DEFAULT_FPS;
	}
	//启动时订阅事件（必须在注册之后调用subscribe才有效）
	plugin.subscribe(pluginId, plugin.events.KEY_DOWN, function(data){
		if(!running) return;
		emit(data.vkcode);
	});
	plugin.subscribe(pluginId, plugin.events.LONG_PRESS, function(data){
		if(!running) return;
		emit(data.vkcode);
	});
	init(ownerForm);
	//初始化后报告运行状态
	plugin.reportStatus(pluginId, "运行中");
};

instance.stop = function(){
	if(!running) return;
	running = false;
	//停止时取消所有订阅
	plugin.unsubscribeAll(pluginId);
	dispose();
	plugin.reportStatus(pluginId, "已停止");
};

instance.dispose = function(){
	running = false;
	dispose();
	plugin.unsubscribeAll(pluginId); //确保订阅清理与资源释放解耦
};

instance.showSettings = function(parentForm){
	//弹出喷图设置对话框（禁止缩放和最大化）
	var settingsForm = win.form(text="按键喷图 设置";right=340;bottom=240;parent=parentForm;border="dialog frame");
	settingsForm.modifyStyle(0x10000/*_WS_MAXIMIZEBOX*/, 0); //禁止最大化
	settingsForm.add(
		//最大粒子数
		staticMax={cls="static";text="最大粒子数:";left=16;top=18;right=110;bottom=38;transparent=1};
		editMax={cls="edit";text=tostring(getMaxParticles());left=120;top=14;right=190;bottom=37;edge=1};
		staticMaxTip={cls="static";text="(5~200)";left=196;top=18;right=260;bottom=38;transparent=1};
		//上升高度
		staticRise={cls="static";text="上升高度:";left=16;top=52;right=110;bottom=72;transparent=1};
		editRise={cls="edit";text=tostring(getRiseScale());left=120;top=48;right=190;bottom=71;edge=1};
		staticRiseTip={cls="static";text="倍率(0.5~3.0)";left=196;top=52;right=300;bottom=72;transparent=1};
		//帧率
		staticFps={cls="static";text="动画帧率:";left=16;top=86;right=110;bottom=106;transparent=1};
		editFps={cls="edit";text=tostring(getFps());left=120;top=82;right=190;bottom=105;edge=1};
		staticFpsTip={cls="static";text="FPS(25~60，重启插件生效)";left=196;top=86;right=350;bottom=106;transparent=1};
		//自动启动
		chkAutoStart={cls="checkbox";text="随主程序自动启动";left=16;top=120;right=210;bottom=140;checked=plugin.getAutoStart(pluginId)};
		//按钮
		btnReset={cls="button";text="重置";left=16;top=168;right=96;bottom=198};
		btnOk={cls="button";text="确定";left=120;top=168;right=210;bottom=198};
		btnCancel={cls="button";text="取消";left=220;top=168;right=310;bottom=198}
	);
	settingsForm.btnReset.oncommand = function(id, event){
		settingsForm.editMax.text = tostring(DEFAULT_MAX_PARTICLES);
		settingsForm.editRise.text = tostring(DEFAULT_RISE_SCALE);
		settingsForm.editFps.text = tostring(DEFAULT_FPS);
		settingsForm.chkAutoStart.checked = true;
	};
	settingsForm.btnOk.oncommand = function(id, event){
		//验证并应用最大粒子数
		var maxP = tonumber(settingsForm.editMax.text);
		if(!maxP || maxP < 5 || maxP > 200){
			settingsForm.editMax.text = tostring(getMaxParticles());
			return;
		}
		setMaxParticles(maxP);

		//验证并应用上升高度倍率
		var riseS = tonumber(settingsForm.editRise.text);
		if(!riseS || riseS < 0.5 || riseS > 3.0){
			settingsForm.editRise.text = tostring(getRiseScale());
			return;
		}
		setRiseScale(riseS);

		//验证并应用帧率
		var fps = tonumber(settingsForm.editFps.text);
		if(!fps || fps < 25 || fps > 60){
			settingsForm.editFps.text = tostring(getFps());
			return;
		}
		setFps(fps);

		//持久化保存所有设置到 plugin.json
		plugin.saveConfig(pluginId, {
			maxParticles = maxP;
			riseScale = riseS;
			fps = fps;
			autoStart = settingsForm.chkAutoStart.checked
		});

		settingsForm.close();
	};
	settingsForm.btnCancel.oncommand = function(id, event){
		settingsForm.close();
	};
	settingsForm.doModal();
};

//返回实例表（loadcodex 的返回值会被 plugin.register 保存）
return instance;
